 Format per 1M estimated tokens: [uncached_input, cached_input, output]. claude-fable-5 is the most expensive model, gpt-5.6-luna the cheapest. In scripts/baseline_router.py set CHEAP = {"claude": "claude-sonnet-5", "gpt": "gpt-5.6-luna"}. Re-run baseline_router.py and plot_frontier.py.

